    "name": "Zen&",
    "steam_appid": 3430060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/b1de933a1714a8fc728fca795438a245.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to Elon Musk's Brain-Computer Interface technology, perhaps we can upload our consciousness and become cyber beings when we age. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do the game characters we kill in games also possess their own cyber lives? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will killing them bring us cyber karma? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cyber beads to eliminate game karma! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will also bring you better luck and make it easier to obtain rare rewards in other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/78cdb15a0269add206df05c0449690cf.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen is the core resource in ZEN&amp;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more Zen you gain, the more you can change your mindset. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll witness the withering and flourishing of plants, the transformation of mountains and stones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, you will find your inner peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/b6d34c4d66a293186a0134b7a1fa9cbb.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In China, people use plants beads to make mala. The\u00a0Chinese character \u4e32 means mala, because the beads strung together look like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most buyers are not Buddhists, but buying to collect. The market size of prayer beads has reached at least billions of dollars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll become familiar with over ten materials for beads, such as moon and star beads, phoenix-eye beads, vajra beads, etc.(in the initial version, we'll only offer moon and star bodhi seeds). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, the time you spend on the beads will change the appearance of the beads from ordinary to jade-like, which the Chinese call Baojiang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/29d4eb092ecca566049a451c45ed8c43.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This spiritual meditation is not boring or mechanical. We creat 300+ Zen stories in ZEN&amp;. Hope you like them.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/b1de933a1714a8fc728fca795438a245.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to Elon Musk's Brain-Computer Interface technology, perhaps we can upload our consciousness and become cyber beings when we age. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do the game characters we kill in games also possess their own cyber lives? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will killing them bring us cyber karma? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cyber beads to eliminate game karma! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will also bring you better luck and make it easier to obtain rare rewards in other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/78cdb15a0269add206df05c0449690cf.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen is the core resource in ZEN&amp;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more Zen you gain, the more you can change your mindset. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll witness the withering and flourishing of plants, the transformation of mountains and stones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, you will find your inner peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/b6d34c4d66a293186a0134b7a1fa9cbb.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In China, people use plants beads to make mala. The\u00a0Chinese character \u4e32 means mala, because the beads strung together look like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most buyers are not Buddhists, but buying to collect. The market size of prayer beads has reached at least billions of dollars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll become familiar with over ten materials for beads, such as moon and star beads, phoenix-eye beads, vajra beads, etc.(in the initial version, we'll only offer moon and star bodhi seeds). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, the time you spend on the beads will change the appearance of the beads from ordinary to jade-like, which the Chinese call Baojiang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/29d4eb092ecca566049a451c45ed8c43.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This spiritual meditation is not boring or mechanical. We creat 300+ Zen stories in ZEN&amp;. Hope you like them.</p>",
